a-note=\"6e5fa86a227392e1\" href=\"?note=6e5fa86a227392e1\" title=\"20-thm-universal\">20-thm-universal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为对角停机集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e5fa86a227392e1\" href=\"?note=6e5fa86a227392e1\" title=\"20-thm-universal\">20-thm-universal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}K\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nK\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}K\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nK\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in K\">\\(e\\in K\\)</span> 可通过模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(e)\">\\(\\varphi_e(e)\\)</span> 半判定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_K\">\\(\\chi_K\\)</span> 可计算，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x)\">\\(d(x)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_K(x)=0\">\\(\\chi_K(x)=0\\)</span> 时输出 0，否则发散，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\varphi_i\">\\(d=\\varphi_i\\)</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in K\\iff\\varphi_i(i)\\downarrow\\iff i\\notin K\">\\(i\\in K\\iff\\varphi_i(i)\\downarrow\\iff i\\notin K\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorems 1.6.4–1.6.5；印刷页 14；